## Always

1. Read root `AGENTS.md` before large changes.
2. Do not modify `C:\Users\KASRA\Desktop\mashoodwear` (original).
3. Commerce admin = Medusa Admin only (option الف). Do not rebuild Medusa Admin inside Vite `/admin`.
4. Prefer adapter layer under `frontend/src/api/medusa/` over redesigning brand UI.
